WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.334 --> 00:00:02.702
- GOOD MORNING,
LADIES AND GENTLEMEN.

00:00:02.735 --> 00:00:04.404
WE ARE ABOUT
TO BEGIN BOARDING

00:00:04.437 --> 00:00:08.374
SOUTH NORTHERN AIRLINES
FLIGHT 34 TO GRAND RAPIDS.

00:00:08.407 --> 00:00:10.543
- OH, OKAY, I'M--EXCUSE ME.
BOARDING GROUP ONE.

00:00:10.576 --> 00:00:11.577
I'M IN BOARDING GROUP ONE.
EXCUSE ME.

00:00:11.610 --> 00:00:12.545
I'M IN BOARDING GROUP ONE.

00:00:12.578 --> 00:00:16.783
- AND WE WOULD LIKE
TO BEGIN PRE-BOARDING

00:00:16.816 --> 00:00:18.351
WITH OUR FIRST-CLASS
PASSENGERS.

00:00:18.384 --> 00:00:21.454
FIRST-CLASS PASSENGERS
ONLY, PLEASE.

00:00:23.656 --> 00:00:27.293
NEXT, OUR BUSINESS-CLASS
PASSENGERS MAY NOW BOARD.

00:00:29.628 --> 00:00:31.197
OKAY, NOW
WE'D LIKE TO WELCOME

00:00:31.230 --> 00:00:34.067
OUR REGAL ALLIANCE
ELITE MEMBERS.

00:00:34.100 --> 00:00:37.437
REGAL ALLIANCE ELITE
MEMBERS.

00:00:39.638 --> 00:00:41.808
OKAY, NOW ALL PASSENGERS
WITH CHILDREN.

00:00:41.841 --> 00:00:43.176
- OKAY.

00:00:43.209 --> 00:00:44.710
- ANYONE WITH SMALL CHILDREN
MAY BOARD NOW.

00:00:44.743 --> 00:00:48.247
[child fussing]

00:00:48.280 --> 00:00:50.116
- OKAY, WE WOULD LIKE
TO CONTINUE BOARDING

00:00:50.149 --> 00:00:52.285
WITH UNIFORMED
MILITARY PERSONNEL.

00:00:52.318 --> 00:00:53.820
- WHAT?
WHY CAN'T--

00:00:53.853 --> 00:00:56.122
THIS IS--
THANK YOU FOR YOUR SERVICE.

00:00:56.155 --> 00:00:56.789
THANK YOU SO MUCH
FOR YOUR SERVICE.

00:00:56.822 --> 00:00:57.790
GOD BLESS YOU.

00:00:57.823 --> 00:00:59.459
- THANK YOU FOR YOUR SERVICE.

00:00:59.492 --> 00:01:00.860
THANK YOU FOR YOUR SERVICE.

00:01:00.893 --> 00:01:04.864
ALL RIGHT,
PEOPLE IN WHEELCHAIRS.

00:01:04.897 --> 00:01:08.734
ANY PRIESTS, NUNS,
RABBIS, IMAMS.

00:01:08.767 --> 00:01:10.703
- WHAT? WHY DO THEY
GET SPECIAL TREATMENT?

00:01:10.736 --> 00:01:11.704
<i> - AS-SALAAM-ALAIKUM.</i>

00:01:11.737 --> 00:01:14.173
- I'VE NEVER--

00:01:14.206 --> 00:01:15.174
THAT'S TYPICAL.

00:01:15.207 --> 00:01:17.610
- ANY OLD PEOPLE IN WHEELCHAIRS
WITH BABIES?

00:01:17.643 --> 00:01:20.379
[baby cries]

00:01:20.412 --> 00:01:21.480
- DOESN'T SEEM
PARTICULARLY--

00:01:21.513 --> 00:01:24.417
- ANY OLD, RELIGIOUS PEOPLE
WITH MILITARY BABIES?

00:01:24.450 --> 00:01:27.320
- WHAT'S A MILITARY--

00:01:29.355 --> 00:01:32.658
- THANK YOU
FOR YOUR SERVICE.

00:01:32.691 --> 00:01:35.695
JASON SCHWARTZMAN.

00:01:42.868 --> 00:01:45.505
ANYONE WITH A BLUE SUITCASE,
YOU MAY NOW BOARD.

00:01:45.538 --> 00:01:46.873
- FINALLY.

00:01:46.906 --> 00:01:49.342
- NOPE, NOT YOU, SIR.
- NOT ME?

00:01:49.375 --> 00:01:50.610
THIS IS A BLUE SUITCASE.

00:01:50.643 --> 00:01:52.311
- THAT'S A BLUE COMPUTER BAG.

00:01:52.344 --> 00:01:55.148
- SO YOU'RE NOT--
YOU'RE NOT GONNA LET ME ON THEN?

00:01:58.951 --> 00:02:01.454
- [sips loudly]

00:02:01.487 --> 00:02:02.889
- DAMN IT!

00:02:02.922 --> 00:02:05.591
DAMN IT, DAMN IT, DAMN IT,
DAMN IT, DAMN IT!

00:02:05.624 --> 00:02:07.760
GOD DAMN IT!

00:02:07.793 --> 00:02:10.597
- ANYONE WHO DOESN'T
SEEM CRANKY.

00:02:14.667 --> 00:02:16.235
DRUNK PEOPLE.

00:02:16.268 --> 00:02:19.805
WE WILL NOW BE BOARDING
ANY DRUNK PEOPLE.

00:02:19.838 --> 00:02:22.842
DRUNK PEOPLE.

00:02:23.909 --> 00:02:25.845
- [grunts]

00:02:25.878 --> 00:02:27.613
ALL RIGHT, IT'S--

00:02:27.646 --> 00:02:29.248
NOPE, IT'S MY BAG.

00:02:29.281 --> 00:02:31.450
SIR. JUST--

00:02:31.483 --> 00:02:33.786
[groans]

00:02:33.819 --> 00:02:37.190
[indistinct muttering]

00:02:45.764 --> 00:02:48.768
[phone rings]
- OOH.

00:02:48.801 --> 00:02:50.469
HELLO?

00:02:50.502 --> 00:02:52.438
OH, HEY, CHRISTIAN.

00:02:52.471 --> 00:02:53.873
YEAH.

00:02:53.906 --> 00:02:55.575
TOTALLY.

00:02:55.608 --> 00:02:58.578
WELL, YOU HAVE YOUR FAVORITES,
AND I HAVE MY FAVORITES.

00:02:58.611 --> 00:03:00.279
[laughs]
OKAY.

00:03:00.312 --> 00:03:01.714
CALL YOU LATER.

00:03:01.747 --> 00:03:04.817
CIAO, CIAO.

00:03:08.354 --> 00:03:10.756
BOARDING GROUP ONE.

00:03:10.789 --> 00:03:13.226
[dramatic music]

00:03:13.259 --> 00:03:19.465
[sirens wailing]

00:03:19.498 --> 00:03:24.237
[indistinct chatter]

00:03:24.270 --> 00:03:28.674
♪ ♪

00:03:28.707 --> 00:03:29.909
- AND THE FUSELAGE.

00:03:29.942 --> 00:03:31.877
- I FOUND
JASON SCHWARTZMAN!

00:03:31.910 --> 00:03:33.613
ALL RIGHT,
THAT'S EVERYBODY!

00:03:33.646 --> 00:03:36.616
LET'S WRAP IT UP, PEOPLE.

00:03:36.649 --> 00:03:38.284
- [groans]

00:03:38.317 --> 00:03:40.286
BOARDING GROUP ONE
OVER HERE!

00:03:40.319 --> 00:03:42.519
GOT A BOARDING GROUP ONE.
[groans]

